{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the skills. Let me understand the task and the test methods.\n\nThe task is about defining a spec standard and the acceptance criteria for \"spec → dev plan → functionally equivalent implementation\" for the rick project.\n\nThe test method describes three test scenarios:\n\n1. **正常路径 (Normal path)**: \n   - Precondition: repo has `.rick/domain/` and `README.md` readable\n   - Input: new `spec.md` body (four-element template)\n   - Operation: write `.rick/domain/spec.md` + update `README.md` index + `git add`\n   - Expected: `test -f .rick/domain/spec.md` returns 0, `README.md` contains `spec.md` line\n\n2. **边界 (Boundary - four elements complete)**:\n   - Precondition: spec.md already written\n   - Input: body to write (containing four section examples: 模块边界/职责/接口契约/验收标准)\n   - Operation: `for w in 模块边界 职责 接口契约 验收标准; do grep -q \"$w\" .rick/domain/spec.md || exit 1; done`\n   - Expected: exit 0 (four keywords **each** hit, not total ≥1)\n\n3. **异常 (Abnormal - acceptance criteria retrievable + no variable leakage)**:\n   - Precondition: spec.md already written\n   - Operation: `grep -c '功能等价' .rick/domain/spec.md` (≥1) and `grep -c '{{' .rick/domain/spec.md` (=0) and `grep -qE 'dry-run|go test|集成测试' .rick/domain/spec.md` (≥1, actionable criteria enumerated)\n   - Expected: 功能等价 hit ≥1, actionable criteria enumeration hit, and no `{{`\n\nNow I need to write a test script at `/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task1.py`.\n\nThe test script should:\n- Check `.rick/domain/spec.md` exists\n- Check `README.md` contains `spec.md` line\n- Check the four keywords each exist in spec.md: 模块边界, 职责, 接口契约, 验收标准\n- Check `功能等价` appears ≥1\n- Check `{{` appears 0 times\n- Check `dry-run|go test|集成测试` appears (actionable criteria)\n\nLet me first explore the current state of the repo to understand what's there.\n\nLet me check the repository structure and whether `.rick/domain/spec.md` exists yet.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me examine the current repository state to understand the context."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_fLbN4aNF9AKCO36dPQiD9253","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && pwd && ls -la && echo \"--- .rick ---\" && ls -la .rick/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"--- .rick/domain ---\" && ls -la .rick/domain/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO .rick/domain\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_7O6E1NUYzIWKBoqkgkym0752","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"--- README.md ---\" && ls -la README.md 2>/dev/null && head -50 README.md 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO README.md\" && echo \"--- spec.md check ---\" && ls -la .rick/domain/spec.md 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO spec.md\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2144,"output":809,"cacheRead":12672,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":562,"totalTokens":15625,"cost":{"input":0.00093264,"output":0.00070383,"cacheRead":0.000045936,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.001682406}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786899601098,"responseId":"7ab37075-cd11-44a3-bda0-39963bd42fba","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_fLbN4aNF9AKCO36dPQiD9253","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick\ntotal 2632\ndrwxr-xr-x 13 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    4096 Aug 12 18:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    4096 Aug 15 08:39 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    4096 Aug 13 01:12 bin\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    4096 Aug  7 19:53 cmd\n-rw-rw-r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys     179 Aug 12 18:32 config.example.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys   11355 Aug  7 19:53 coverage_git.out\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    9889 Aug  7 19:53 coverage.html\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys h