被代码事实验证并固化后，可迁移到 `domain`；`domain` 中过时部分由 `dream` 周期性清理。\n\n在这个视角下，命令体系是作用于知识体系的控制手段。`doing` 与 `easy` 是熵增的源头（执行过程产生上下文），`learning` 是增强回路（把单次 job 的经验提取为 loops/skills，让下次更准），`dream` 是调节回路（跨 job 反思、淘汰失效 loops/skills、维持 `domain` 简洁），`human-loop` 是人类介入深度思考的入口（产出 `draft`），`ctrl` 是黑箱执行的可挂测性设计（人类对 doing 进行干预）。主要矛盾是\"上下文熵增\"与\"AI coding 准确性\"之间的势能差，Rick 通过 learning 的增强回路和 dream 的调节回路共同对抗这一熵增，让后续的 AI agent 越跑越准。\n\n--- spec.md check ---\nNO spec.md\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786899612903},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `.rick/domain/` directory exists but `spec.md` doesn't yet exist. This is the RED phase — the test should fail because the feature isn't implemented yet.\n\nLet me also check the `.rick/domain/README.md` to understand what the index looks like, and check the top-level README.md to understand the index.\n\nActually, the test method says:\n- 正常路径: 前置条件 = repo has `.rick/domain/` and `README.md` readable; input = new `spec.md` body (four-element template); operation = write `.rick/domain/spec.md` + update `README.md` index + `git add`; expected = `test -f .rick/domain/spec.md` returns 0, `README.md` contains `spec.md` line.\n\nWait, the \"README.md\" here — is it the top-level `README.md` or `.rick/domain/README.md`? Let me check the `.rick/domain/README.md`.\n\nThe test method mentions \"更新 `README.md` 索引\" (update README.md index). Let me check what README.md contains an index of domain files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_m3RxW07LD7tecp51MkYg0651","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"=== .rick/domain/README.md ===\" && cat .rick/domain/README.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_1IQK1UFT6HrnecuJ5fHl2021","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"=== grep domain in top README.md ===\" && grep -n \"domain\\|architecture.md\\|spec.md\\|README\" README.md | head -40"}}],"api":"openai-comp